{"source_passage_id": "HHS4867-L06-POSTURAL-GAIT-P0033-PASSAGE", "text": "Modified Functional Ambulation Categories (MFAC)\nCat.\nStage\nDefinition\nLyer\nUnable to walk / unable to sit without support>1min / assist to sit\nSitter\nSit without support >1min / unable to walk with 1 person assistance\nIII\nDependent\nWalk with 1 person assistance – level ground (continuous manual contact to support body\nWalker\nweight)\nAssisted Walker\nWalk with 1 person assistance – level ground (continuous or intermittent manual contact)\nSupervised\nWalk with standby guarding from 1 person – level ground\nWalker\nIndoor Walker\nTransfer, turn & walk on level ground independently, needs assistance on stairs/inclines\nVII\nOutdoor Walker\nWalk independently on level or non-level surfaces", "document_id": "HHS4867-L06-POSTURAL-GAIT", "document_title": "Lecture 6 - Postural Assessment and Gait", "source_file": "19 - 6. Postural and Gait 姿勢及步態評估.pdf", "source_page_ids": ["HHS4867-L06-POSTURAL-GAIT-P0033"], "source_pages": [{"source_page_id": "HHS4867-L06-POSTURAL-GAIT-P0033", "document_id": "HHS4867-L06-POSTURAL-GAIT", "document_title": "Lecture 6 - Postural Assessment and Gait", "source_file": "19 - 6. Postural and Gait 姿勢及步態評估.pdf", "page_number": 33, "page_number_type": "slide_number", "slide_number": 33, "pdf_page": 33, "formatted": "19 - 6. Postural and Gait 姿勢及步態評估.pdf, slide 33 (PDF p. 33)"}], "slide_number": 33, "section_ids": ["HHS4867-L06-POSTURAL-GAIT-P0033", "HHS4867-L06-POSTURAL-GAIT-PART04", "HHS4867-L06-POSTURAL-GAIT", "HHS4867-COURSE"], "section_path": ["HHS4867 - Functional Movement Science", "Lecture 6 - Postural Assessment and Gait", "Functional mobility tests", "Modified Functional Ambulation Categories (MFAC)"], "content_type": "slide_text", "ocr_text": null, "status": "generated_not_verified", "verification_status": "generated_not_verified"}
